      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alma sits at the edge of the Ozark Mountains in the Arkansas River Valley, giving it a mix of flat plains and scenic hill country.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alma%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lake Alma, created by an earthen dam on Little Frog Bayou, supplies the city’s tap water and sits just northeast of downtown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
